  "id": "salmon-and-spinach-fettuccine",
  "name": "Salmon and Spinach Fettuccine",
  "subtitle": "Creamy pasta with smoked salmon, spinach, and capers",
  "description": "Fettuccine is coated in a Parmesan cream sauce with smoked salmon, spinach, capers, sun-dried tomatoes, and oregano.",
